            <ArticleTitle>Assessment and management of pain in the paediatric patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>35-40</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A combination of pharmacological and non-pharmacological interventions can ensure the highest standard of care in the management of pain in children. Nurses are in a prime position to care for children and educate them and their parents on effective pain management strategies.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
